<workout_file><author>mywhooshinfo.com</author><name>Cruise Intervals #3</name><description>Today&#039;s session consists of 3 x 12-minute cruise intervals. Cruise intervals are performed within Zone 4. However, each 12-minute interval is proceeded by a 30 second Zone 5 interval. 

However, we change the target power every minute from 92% to 97%. Focus on controlled breathing and pedalling at a cadence similar to your Time Trial cadence.</description><sportType>bike</sportType><workout>
<Warmup  Duration="300" PowerLow="0.44999998807907" PowerHigh="0.75"><textevent timeoffset="60" message="A gradual increase in power during the warmup."/><textevent timeoffset="90" message="Today&#039;s warm up takes you through low power, 30sec efforts."/><textevent timeoffset="140" message="The main set, is a challenging zone 4 effort."/><textevent timeoffset="160" message="We add to the training stimulus by changing the target power every minute."/><textevent timeoffset="180" message="The aim is to not settle into a rhythm, with the target power constantly changing."/><textevent timeoffset="280" message="Now to complete your warmup with some gentle over/under&#039;s."/></Warmup>
<IntervalsT   Repeat="4" OnDuration="30" OnPower="0.64999997615814" OffDuration="30" OffPower="0.88999998569489">
</IntervalsT>
<SteadyState  Duration="180" Power="0.5"><textevent timeoffset="45" message="A short recovery period before the main sets."/><textevent timeoffset="90" message="We have 3 x 12min zone 4 efforts today."/><textevent timeoffset="110" message="However, the 12min efforts begin with a 30sec acceleration at high power."/><textevent timeoffset="160" message="Ready for the first effort."/></SteadyState>
<SteadyState  Duration="30" Power="1.1000000238419"><textevent timeoffset="10" message="High power and cadence here."/><textevent timeoffset="20" message="We go straight into the zone 4 effort."/></SteadyState>
<IntervalsT   Repeat="6" OnDuration="60" OnPower="0.9200000166893" OffDuration="60" OffPower="0.97000002861023">
</IntervalsT>
<SteadyState  Duration="120" Power="0.5"><textevent timeoffset="30" message="Just a short recovery."/></SteadyState>
<SteadyState  Duration="30" Power="1.1000000238419"><textevent timeoffset="10" message="High power and cadence here."/><textevent timeoffset="20" message="We go straight into the zone 4 effort."/></SteadyState>
<IntervalsT   Repeat="6" OnDuration="60" OnPower="0.9200000166893" OffDuration="60" OffPower="0.97000002861023">
</IntervalsT>
<SteadyState  Duration="120" Power="0.5"><textevent timeoffset="30" message="Just a short recovery now."/><textevent timeoffset="90" message="Ready for the next effort."/><textevent timeoffset="0" message="Into the last effort now."/></SteadyState>
<SteadyState  Duration="30" Power="1.1000000238419"><textevent timeoffset="10" message="High power and cadence here."/><textevent timeoffset="20" message="We go straight into the zone 4 effort."/></SteadyState>
<IntervalsT   Repeat="6" OnDuration="60" OnPower="0.9200000166893" OffDuration="60" OffPower="0.97000002861023">
</IntervalsT>
<SteadyState  Duration="180" Power="0.5"><textevent timeoffset="100" message="That&#039;s a great session. Well done."/></SteadyState>
<Cooldown  Duration="300" PowerLow="0.75" PowerHigh="0.44999998807907"><textevent timeoffset="30" message="We need a good cool down after that session."/><textevent timeoffset="50" message="Important to bring the HR down from high to low gradually."/></Cooldown>
</workout></workout_file>